{"duration": 36.411, "segs": [{"id": "prologue", "start": 0.35, "end": 4.408, "text": "Dix mille euros par mois en ligne ? Voici le plan. Accroche-toi."}, {"id": "offre", "start": 4.658, "end": 9.15, "text": "Étape un : une offre à cent euros. Cent clients par mois, et c'est dix mille."}, {"id": "claude", "start": 9.4, "end": 14.818, "text": "Étape deux : Claude écrit tes scripts, tes posts et tes emails. En quelques secondes."}, {"id": "auto", "start": 15.068, "end": 19.169, "text": "Étape trois : avec Claude, tu crées ta page de vente et tu automatises tes vidéos."}, {"id": "publie", "start": 19.419, "end": 23.516, "text": "Étape quatre : tu publies chaque jour, et tu réponds à chaque message."}, {"id": "fin", "start": 23.766, "end": 33.811, "text": "C'est un système, pas de la magie. J'explique tout, étape par étape, dans ma formation de marketing digital. Écris VIP en commentaire, et je t'envoie tout."}], "words": [{"w": "Dix", "a": 0.35, "b": 0.54, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "mille", "a": 0.604, "b": 0.921, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "euros", "a": 0.984, "b": 1.301, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "par", "a": 1.364, "b": 1.555, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "mois", "a": 1.618, "b": 1.872, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "en", "a": 1.935, "b": 2.062, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "ligne", "a": 2.125, "b": 2.442, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "?", "a": 2.506, "b": 2.569, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "Voici", "a": 2.633, "b": 2.95, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "le", "a": 3.013, "b": 3.14, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "plan.", "a": 3.203, "b": 3.52, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "Accroche-toi.", "a": 3.584, "b": 4.408, "seg": "prologue"}, {"w": "Étape", "a": 4.658, "b": 4.95, "seg": "offre"}, {"w": "un", "a": 5.008, "b": 5.125, "seg": "offre"}, {"w": ":", "a": 5.183, "b": 5.241, "seg": "offre"}, {"w": "une", "a": 5.3, "b": 5.475, "seg": "offre"}, {"w": "offre", "a": 5.533, "b": 5.825, "seg": "offre"}, {"w": "à", "a": 5.883, "b": 5.941, "seg": "offre"}, {"w": "cent", "a": 6.0, "b": 6.233, "seg": "offre"}